tip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Wood\" title=\"Wood\">Wood</a>:</b> <b>Wood</b> is common for use in <a href=\"/page/Quarterstaff\" title=\"Quarterstaff\">Quarterstaffs</a>, <a href=\"/page/Bow\" title=\"Bow\">bows</a>, or <a href=\"/page/Ammo\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Ammo\">ammo</a>. It is light, but its durability is low.</span></span> \n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Hardness\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\">5\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Base Value\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\"><span style=\"display: none;\">0000000001</span>1<span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\">cp<span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"/page/Currency\" title=\"Currency\">Copper Piece</a></span></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Weight\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\">3 lbs\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Location\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\"><b><a href=\"/page/None\" title=\"None\">None</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Enchantments\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\">\n<ul><li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Enhancement_Bonus\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Enhancement Bonus\">-1 Enhancement Bonus</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Enhancement_Bonus\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Enhancement Bonus\">-1 Enhancement Bonus</a>:</b> This weapon is less well-made than normal, giving a -1 penalty to attack and damage rolls.</span></span></li></ul>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC; vertical-align: middle;\" rowspan=\"4\" align=\"center\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/page/File:Club_of_the_Holy_Flame.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Club_of_the_Holy_Flame.jpg/420px-Club_of_the_Holy_Flame.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"420\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Club_of_the_Holy_Flame.jpg 1.5x\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Upgradeable?\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\">\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Description\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\"><i>This club glows faintly and is inscribed with religious markings.</i>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Tips\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\">\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p>\n<ul><li><span style=\"background-color: initial; color: #FF0000;\"><span style=\"font-size: larger; font-weight: inherit;\"><i>This item cannot be fed to <a href=\"/page/Sentient_Weapon\" title=\"Sentient Weapon\">sentient jewels</a>.</i></span></span>\n<ul><li>Given by Colam Mersein after completion of Part 1 of story arc of <a href=\"/page/Delera%27s_Tomb\" title=\"Delera&#39;s Tomb\">Delera's Tomb</a></li></ul></li>\n<li>This weapon is considered a Ki weapon, and can be used by <a href=\"/page/Monk\" title=\"Monk\">Monks</a> or those with <a href=\"/page/Grandmaster_of_Flowers\" title=\"Grandmaster of Flowers\">Grandmaster of Flowers</a> without penalty</li>\n<li>For players without a <a href=\"/page/Good_aligned\" title=\"Good aligned\">Good aligned</a> weapon (for example, Holy or Pure Good, or made of <a href=\"/page/Flametouched_Iron\" title=\"Flametouched Iron\">Flametouched Iron</a>), this special weapon can be used against the <a href=\"/page/Ghostly_Skeleton\" title=\"Ghostly Skeleton\">Ghostly Skeletons</a> found in the dungeons of Delera's Tomb, which are highly resistant to non-Good physical damage (not to relevant extra damage, though).</li></ul>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260817035848\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.069 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.118 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 3542/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 21602/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 5674/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 32/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/200\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2019/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 13/150\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n121.55%  125.986     39 Template:IO\n100.00%  103.647      1 Template:Named_item\n100.00%  103.647      1 -total\n 97.52%  101.080      1 Template:Named_Weapon\n 41.29%   42.797      2 Template:Lamannia_picture\n 40.51%   41.989      2 Template:IsLamannia\n 39.14%   40.568      2 Template:IsSpeculation\n 38.25%   39.646      2 Template:InCategory\n 21.22%   21.990      1 Template:Non-food\n 18.95%   19.637      1 Template:Red\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key ddowiki:pcache:idhash:12916-0!canonical and timestamp 20260817035848 and revision id 640745. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"
